-- deployed for the first time, public.house_addresses starts empty and
-- the admin fills it from the /admin panel. The /map page already
-- handles an empty list correctly (it just shows the 6 address
-- categories and no houses).
--
-- This file is intentionally empty; it's kept as step 08 so the
-- pipeline doesn't have to renumber the other files.
